### Partners of the dashboard (VS Code REST Client or any HTTP client; run `npm run watch` first)
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/partner-dashboard/Partners

### Only the ID and the name, companies first by name
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/partner-dashboard/Partners?$select=ID,name&$filter=category eq '2'&$orderby=name

### One partner, read directly from the mocked SAP API with the names of SAP
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/api-business-partner/A_BusinessPartner('1000003')?$select=BusinessPartner,BusinessPartnerFullName,BusinessPartnerCategory

### The number of partners
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/partner-dashboard/Partners/$count
